---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Gianfranco Palumbo"
  description="I'm Gianfranco Palumbo, a software engineer and co-founder based in Madrid. I've spent 14 years building products, sitting close to the people who use them."
>
  <header class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">About</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-custom prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
    <p>
      I'm Gianfranco Palumbo, a software engineer and co-founder based in Madrid. I've spent 14 years
      building products, and the part I enjoy most is sitting close to the people who use them: understanding
      the real problem, shipping a fix, and watching it work in production.
    </p>
    <p>
      I co-founded <a href="https://holabrisa.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">holaBrisa</a>, a voice, email and WhatsApp assistant that answers guests 24/7 for independent
      hotels. I own it end to end, from discovery calls with hotel operators to PMS integrations, real-time
      voice infrastructure, evals and late-night production debugging. Alongside that, I freelance for
      MoveFlux, a small digital agency, building full-stack and AI systems for its clients, including voice
      agents running for paying customers since 2023.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started at MongoDB in Dublin, helping enterprise teams debug their production databases. That's where
      I learned to like the customer side of engineering. Since then I've built Ryanair's taxi booking engine
      at CarTrawler, designed an identity-verification component library at the IOTA Foundation, and
      co-founded Onova as CTO.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days I'm most interested in what it takes to make AI agents reliable inside real businesses: what
      context they need, how you know they're working, and where a human should step in. That's the work I
      want to do next, embedded with customers in Forward Deployed or Applied AI roles.
    </p>
    <p>
      TypeScript, React, Node.js, Python, FastAPI, LiveKit, Google ADK, Vercel AI SDK, TanStack AI, RAG,
      MongoDB, Postgres. I speak English, Spanish and Italian.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
